                   <p><milestone type="pagelike" unit="face" n="B"/><label xml:lang="eng">Face B</label>
                   <lb n="B1"/><gap reason="illegible" extent="unknown" unit="character"/>
                      <lb n="B2"/>… kansrVk kaṁvrau qutpala kr̥s ka{6}
                      <lb n="B3"/>… kanden sot kanqas kampit smyāñ malayā kan{4}
                      <lb n="B4"/>…k sot de{1} vraḥ kalpa kr̥ṣṇāṅgī kansā samāp tā
                      <lb n="B5"/>…yV srukk sos not nau qnak ta mān ta gi neḥ sruk syaṅ ti kalpa Oy vnvāk
                      <lb n="B6"/>… man jvan purohite gi nā svatantra gi kalpanā puro
                      <lb n="B7"/>… caraṇāmvuja nai pradhāna neḥ kalpanā kr̥takr̥tya vvoṁ jā pi hoc cren
                      <lb n="B8"/>… Artha man Añ ni {1} vvoṁ jā pi yok nu caṁmren le Artha dai
                      <lb n="B9"/>… khloñ vala ta khloñ {2} cāṅ nu khloñ vala ta khloñ gmāll yūgapat nu pādamūla
                      <lb n="B10"/>… Āy ti lic lāc pi duk cval ta praśasta dhana {2} kalpaṇā {2} liḥ syaṅ toy
                      <lb n="B11"/>… khñuṁ si thgāp tai kaṁvai si thleṁ si Āntis si saṅkauv jāhnavī tai śā{1} tai {3} tai {1}
                      <lb n="B12"/>… tai phtyak si kaṁpit tai parap si kaṁvai tai bhadra tai chpoṅ tai bhāva si kaṁvraḥ si
                      <lb n="B13"/>… ktāCiCi Āy ti lic lāc vvaṁ Āc ti mān ta kva[n] cauv mvāy {1}ryya nuv {4}
                   </p>
<lg n="1" met="anuṣṭubh" xml:lang="san-Latn">
<l n="a"><lb n="B14"/>yāvaś caturmmukho vrahmā</l>
<l n="b">viṣṇur yyāvaś caturbhujaḥ</l>
<l n="c">tāvat trilocanaś śambhoḥ</l>
<l n="d">yāvat svārgge vasanti te <g ref="sym:doubleBar" type="punctuation">.</g></l>
</lg>
  <lg n="2" met="anuṣṭubh" xml:lang="san-Latn">
